/-!
# Limit preservation of the structure morphism, at free universes

The structure morphism `𝒳 ⟶ (Sch/S)_{fppf}` of a limit preserving category fibred in groupoids
is limit preserving on objects, at free universes of `𝒳`:
`AlgebraicGeometry.Stack.isLimitPreservingOverTerminal_of_isLimitPreserving`.

That declaration lives in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Stacks.LimitPreservingStructureMorphismSupplement`; this module
is the import path under which `StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Stacks.ArtinCriterion` reaches it,
and re-exports that module.
-/
